  "title": "Don't notify me about my comment",
  "content": "<p>I have topic. I <a href=\"https://community.st.com/feedback-forum-118/allow-to-edit-posts-166661\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow ugc\" target=\"_self\">can’t edit</a> original post so I should add comment when I have new information/solution for a problem. Then I got new Notification. I suggest to not notify user about his comments.</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/a1f744b1-a180-44cb-937e-9856a3432e3b.png\" /></figure><p> </p>",
